people of the internet's retroarching  tour here i'm just a dad who loves games  and the stories they tell and here we  are yet again and we are asking the  question  is this the moment that we see hogwarts  legacy yet again that's right sony has  announced a state of play event coming  up this wednesday at 2 p.m pacific time  5 pm eastern time and this is one that  clearly states the focus is to be on  third party releases now i think the  first thing we need to look at is does  hogwarts legacy even qualify let's take  a look at the exact wording of the  playstation announcement i'll pull it up  right here so you guys can see it so  here is the tweet that they sent out  wednesday october 27th again 2 p.m  pacific time but if you actually click  the link there's going to be more  information there that talks a lot more  about this and we can look at that and  see  does hogwarts legacy even qualify so  there are a couple of key lines i want  to draw your attention to we're going to  go ahead and zoom in here so you can see  this a little bit better but the first  one we should talk about is the second  section right here which reads as  follows this time out we'll be focusing  on announcements and updates for  upcoming third-party releases headed to  ps5 and ps4 well there you have it so  far so good hogwarts legacy is a third  party game and it is heading to ps5 and  ps4 now even though hogwarts legacy fits  there we definitely have to talk about  that word upcoming right because what do  they mean by upcoming the most likely  explanation is games releasing before  the end of the year i know that's  probably not what you want to hear but  let's keep reading the show is looking  to be about 20 minutes or so and we'll  share new looks at previously announced  games plus a few reveals from our  partners around the world now i don't  know about you guys but when i hear  updates to previously announced games my  alarm bells are kind of going off and i  know  we find ourselves in the same position  yet again we've been here how many times  now guys on the verge of a big event  saying  yes it's going to be here this is the  moment i'm not going to do that this  time i'm sorry i'm just not going to do  it and it's because i don't want to have  my heart broken yet again i just don't  want to do that but if i sort of remove  that from the equation and just sort of  think with my head only here  i gotta be honest i do think it makes a  lot of sense for hogwarts legacy to be  at this event we're coming up on the end  of the year they've already announced  all the stuff they're going to be really  pushing this holiday season now will we  see some things that are coming out this  year absolutely they're going to be  focusing on third party titles that are  coming out this year but nowhere in this  announcement does it say titles that are  only releasing this year and here's the  thing that really gives me hope guys  because hogwarts legacy we already know  that it was slated to release this year  and was delayed we've been talking all  year is it going to be an early 2022 is  it going to be mid 2022 is it going to  be late 2022 and we've went this whole  entire year without hearing any updates  whatsoever so if there was any shot at  all that we're going to see even sort of  a first half of 2022 release and i'm  talking like january to maybe all the  way through june july that range then  this would be the time for it this would  be the moment now you can't forget about  the game awards that's true it's still  out there it's happening in december so  it could definitely appear there as well  but if we are right that sony has the  marketing for hogwarts legacy which i  think it's pretty clear that they do  then this event right here makes the  most sense i mean to be honest hogwarts  legacy could be here and then again at  the game awards if they really wanted to  start pushing it out but for me i think  it all comes down to just how far along  is it is it gonna release in the first  half of 2022 or is it gonna be a holiday  game if it's gonna be a holiday 2022  game then we're probably not going to  see it here and if we do see it there  then maybe just maybe we'll actually get  a release date now as always i have to  be completely honest with you guys i  love hype i absolutely love building  hype i love being a part of the hype  train when things are really exciting i  think that stuff is awesome around games  but i also think you have to be on the  opposite side of that as well and i have  to be upfront and honest with you guys  when i don't think something will happen  and if i'm putting a number on this i  would probably say the odds of hogwarts  legacy being here are pretty low maybe  around 15 if i'm again that's just me  completely just a guess because i do  think it could be here i think it makes  sense if sony has the marketing rights  to show it here but really the only way  i could see it happening here if it's an  early 2022 release and thus far  everything we've seen doesn't really  indicate that it is now i'd love to be  wrong in fact i hope i am wrong i hope  on wednesday night there's a video going  up of me live reacting to a new trailer  or something like that because  you already know i will have the news up  on it as quickly as i possibly can now  to be completely fair i was all in on  hogwarts legacy being at the last  playstation event and was completely  wrong obviously on that so maybe i'll be  wrong on this one as well and it will  actually show up and i gotta be honest  part of it is probably me just trying to  temper my own expectations so i don't  get let down again because it's already  happened so many times  but maybe maybe guys this is the time by  the way i also want to mention the hat  that i always wear here you guys can  actually purchase one of your own  because we have officially launched a  retro rack into our store and thanks to  you for helping me hit 10 000  subscribers that is actually integrated  directly into youtube so you can see all  the stuff that's on the store right  below this video i think we got some  pretty cool shirts and of course i love  the hat so if you guys check that out  let me know what you like the best as  always thank you all so much for  watching i'll talk to you again soon

